  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      394.4,
      319.07,
      558.32
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice, under Sub section (1) of section 7 of the land acquisition (amendment) act, No. 28 of 1964 that the government intend to acquire the following lands which are required for a public purpose:- Description of the land intend to acquire: An allotment of land in total extent of about 0.0354 hectare depicted Lot No. 01 in the Advance Tracing No. Gam/4101 dated 13.08.2018 prepared by the Senior Superintendent of Surveys of Village called Makola in Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Biyagama in Adikari Pattuwa of Gampaha Disstrict of Western Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.118988037109375,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      560.0,
      289.11,
      620.23
    ],
    "text": "Allotment No. 01 Name of the Land: Diualagahawatta; Description: Croft, Temporary Building, Water Tank, A well and inter cropping; Owners: D. I. Wickramarathne, No. 203/4, Makola South, Makola; Extent: 0.0354 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.56,
      343.28,
      547.28,
      399.44
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid Lands are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, for me at Divisional Secretariat of Biyagama on and at the following mentioned dates and times:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.56,
      400.64,
      539.82,
      502.88
    ],
    "text": "Date Allotment Number Time 2018.11.07 01 10.a.m. Further claimants should inform me with two copies of detailed descriptions of how they have computed the compensation and the points of how they are eligible for the said compensation, before 31st of October 2018.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
